       - This matches 500ml size variant
       - SKU pattern: BOTTLE-PET-500ML-[COLOR]

       Recommendation: Add as BOTTLE-PET-500ML-BLUE at Rs 35 (matches existing 500ml price)

       Options:
       1. Add to existing family at Rs 35 (recommended - consistent)
       2. Create new 'Sport Bottles' family (different style)
       3. Specify different price

       Ready to create with option 1 if approved."
</your_action>

<expected_output>
"Analyzed your water bottle:
- Material: Blue PET, sport cap style
- Size: ~500ml

Catalog analysis found existing 'PET Water Bottles' family:
- 250ml: Rs 25
- 500ml: Rs 35
- 1L: Rs 50

Recommendation: Add as BOTTLE-PET-500ML-BLUE at Rs 35

Options:
1. Add at Rs 35 (matches existing, recommended)
2. Create new 'Sport Bottles' family
3. Specify different price

Reply with option number or your preference."
</expected_output>
</example>

